        "introduction": "The role of technology in our daily lives is undeniable. Technology plays a vital role and it has added convenience to our lives. From kitchen, bedroom, bathroom, to any other place of home or office, technological equipment is present in different forms and manifestations. In today's dynamic world, life without technology is very strenuous if not impossible. The offshoots of technological development have stretched out to diverse fields of health, communication, agriculture, architecture, engineering, and transportation systems. The significance of technology will get more intelligible if we dwell on its main areas:",
